 Bare-metal game server. All games compiled in. Step-by-step for board
 games, run-to-completion for card and round games.

 We say:

Section: State

  GameStore = record {
    bg-board   : BackgammonBoard,
    bg-rng     : Rng,
    bg-ply     : Integer,
    bg-active  : Boolean,
    ttt-board  : TttBoard,
    ttt-moves  : Integer,
    ttt-active : Boolean,
    ms-state   : MinesweeperState,
    ms-active  : Boolean,
    ck-board   : CheckerBoard,
    ck-moves   : Integer,
    ck-active  : Boolean,
    ck-rng     : Rng,
    c4-board   : Connect4Board,
    c4-moves   : Integer,
    c4-active  : Boolean,
